WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.616
Are you eligible for Amazon Ads Promotions?

00:00:02.616 --> 00:00:07.100
They can be useful for maximizing campaign performance while managing advertising costs.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.265
In this video, you'll learn how Amazon Ads Promotional offers work, how to redeem them, and how

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:15.000
you can monitor your credits in the ad console.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.719
Step 1.

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:16.797
Understand your offer.

00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:21.111
Start by reviewing the offer communication and the terms and conditions carefully.

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:27.222
You'll want to note the amount of credit, the eligible marketplace, the promo dates, and the required

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:28.300
action to qualify.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.033
Step 2.

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:30.500
Complete the qualifying action.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.100
This could mean relaunching a campaign, advertising a new ASIN, or trying a new ad type and spending

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.300
X amount depending on the offer.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.209
Just follow the steps during the promo period.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:43.300
It's that simple.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.027
Step 3.

00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:45.118
Track your credits.

00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:49.482
Once you've qualified, your credits appear in your account within 14 days.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:55.300
Visit the promotions page in the ad console to easily monitor your offers, check credit status,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.967
and view your remaining credit balance all in one convenient location.

00:00:58.967 --> 00:01:04.300
Your promo terms and conditions will also show how long your credits last, usually 30 days.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.391
So, don't wait.

00:01:05.391 --> 00:01:07.936
Put them to work before they expire.

00:01:07.936 --> 00:01:12.300
Log into the Amazon Ads console and redeem your promotional offer today.
